    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋatukon a ŋasigarya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Epite lo iŋes egiritere Ŋisirael, ŋikapolokinitok a ŋikalya, ŋikapolokinitok a ŋasigarya a ŋalipulipui, a ŋamiamiae ka ŋikapolok kec, ŋulu eŋarakinito erwosit anakiro a daadaŋ a ŋuna a ŋatukon a ŋasigarya a ŋuna etiyaete a ŋololap alotooma ekaru daadaŋ. Ayakasi ŋinatukot ŋasigarya ŋalipyo ŋatomoniarei ka ŋaomwon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atukot ŋina ka apei, alolap a ŋolo ke epei, arae Yasobeam lokoku a Sabidiel apolokinit. Ayakasi natukot keŋ ŋikilyok ŋalipyo ŋatomoniarei ka ŋaomwon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae Yasobeam lopapait a Peres, ido iŋes apolokinit ŋikapolok a ŋasigarya daadaŋ alolap a ŋolo esyaunan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atukot ŋina a ŋaarei, alolap a ŋolo a ŋiarei, arae Eaoit ŋolo anyaritae Dodai apolokinit, arae Mikilo atupit iŋes anapolokinit atukot ŋina a ŋaarei. Ayakasi natukot keŋ ŋikilyok ŋalipyo ŋatomoniarei ka ŋaomwon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekapolokiniton ŋasigarya alolap a ŋolo a ŋiuni, arae Benaia lokoku a Yeoiada a ŋolo arae esacaradoti. Ayakasi natukot keŋ ŋikilyok ŋalipyo ŋatomoniarei ka ŋaomwon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae Benaia epei a ŋulutomoniuni a ŋulu etirok ka arae iŋes apolokinit ŋul ŋatomoniuni. Arae lokoku keŋ Amisabad iŋes apolokinit atukot Abenaia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atukot ŋina a ŋaomwon, alolap a ŋolo a ŋiomwon, arae Asael lokaato a Yoab apolokinit; abu ekaku lokoku keŋ Sebadia kilunyokin lokicoloŋ keŋ toruwor ekapolokiniton atukot ŋin. Ayakasi natukot keŋ ŋikilyok ŋalipyo ŋatomoniarei ka ŋaomwon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atukot ŋina a ŋakan, alolap a ŋolo a ŋikan, arae Eisirait ŋolo anyaritae Samus iŋes apolokinit. Ayakasi natukot keŋ ŋikilyok ŋalipyo ŋatomoniarei ka ŋaomwon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atukot ŋina a ŋakanikapei, alolap a ŋolo a ŋikanikapei, arae Ira lokoku a Ikes a ŋolo arae Etekoit iŋes apolokinit. Ayakasi natukot keŋ ŋikilyok ŋalipyo ŋatomoniarei ka ŋaomwon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atukot ŋina a ŋakanikaarei, alolap a ŋolo a ŋikanikaarei, arae Epelonit ŋolo alo Epuraim, ŋolo anyaritae Eles iŋes apolokinit. Ayakasi natukot keŋ ŋikilyok ŋalipyo ŋatomoniarei ka ŋaomwon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atukot ŋina a ŋakanikauni, alolap a ŋolo a ŋikanikauni, arae Eusait ŋolo anateker a Ŋiserai, ŋolo anyaritae Sibekai iŋes apolokinit. Ayakasi natukot keŋ ŋikilyok ŋalipyo ŋatomoniarei ka ŋaomwon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atukot ŋina a ŋakanikaomwon, alolap a ŋolo a ŋikanikaomwon arae Eanasoit ŋolo alokabila a Benjamin, ŋolo anyaritae Abieser iŋes apolokinit. Ayakasi natukot keŋ ŋikilyok ŋalipyo ŋatomoniarei ka ŋaomwon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atukot ŋina a ŋatomon, alolap a ŋolo a ŋitomon, arae Enetopasit ŋolo anateker a Ŋiserai, ŋolo anyaritae Maarai apolokinit. Ayakasi natukot keŋ ŋikilyok ŋalipyo ŋatomoniarei ka ŋaomwon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atukot ŋina a ŋatomon ka apei, alolap a ŋolo a ŋitomon ka epei, arae Epirasonit ŋolo anyaritae Benaia, ŋolo alokabila ke Epuraim apolokinit. Ayakasi natukot keŋ ŋikilyok ŋalipyo ŋatomoniarei ka ŋaomwon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atukot ŋina a ŋatomon ka ŋaarei, arae Enetopasit ŋolo alokal ka Osiniel, ŋolo anyaritae Elidai apolokinit. Ayakasi natukot keŋ ŋikilyok ŋalipyo ŋatomoniarei ka ŋaomwon.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋikarikok a ŋikabilae",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arae lu ŋikarikok a ŋikabilae alo Isirael: Ŋolo apolokinit Ŋirubeni iŋes Elieser lokoku a Siciri; ŋolo apolokinit Ŋisimeoni iŋes Sepatia lokoku a Maaka; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋolo apolokinit ŋilepi iŋes Asabia lokoku a Kemuel; ŋolo apolokinit ŋituŋa ka Aron iŋes Sadok; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋolo apolokinit ŋituŋa a Yuda iŋes Eliu lokaato keŋ a Daudi; ŋolo apolokinit ŋituŋa a Isakar iŋes Omiri lokoku a Mikael; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋolo apolokinit ŋituŋa a Sebulon iŋes Isimaia lokoku ka Obadia; ŋolo apolokinit ŋituŋa a Naputali iŋes Yerimos lokoku ka Asiriel; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋolo apolokinit ŋituŋa ke Epuraim iŋes Osea lokoku ka Asasia; ŋolo apolokinit ŋituŋa ka atutubet ka apei a ŋituŋa a Manase iŋes Yoel lokoku a Pedaia; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋolo apolokinit ŋituŋa ka atutubet a ŋinace a ŋituŋa a Manase alo Gilead iŋes Ido lokoku a Sakariya; ŋolo apolokinit ŋituŋa a Benjamin iŋes Yasiel lokoku ka Abiner; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋolo apolokinit ŋituŋa a Dan iŋes Asarel lokoku a Yeroam. Arae ŋul ŋikapolok ŋulu apolokinito ŋikabilae a Ŋisirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Daudi nyimar ŋikilyok ŋulu arae ŋikaru kec ŋatomoniarei ka ŋulu pa adolito ŋikaru kec ŋatomoniarei, anerae aris Ekapolon kiik akitalalaun Ŋisirael tolalaar ekimar kec ikwa ŋikacer. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu Yoab lokoku a Seruia kisyak akimar ŋikilyok, nai abu nyirikak akimar, kikote neni daŋ, abu anyunyura ka Akuj min neni a Ŋisirael aŋuna ka akimar, aŋun, aponi nyigiri ekimar ŋolo eyookino lokitaabo ŋolo egiri erwosit Daudi ŋakiro a ŋirwa a ŋulu epukator iŋes.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋikapolok ka apukan ŋice",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asimapes lokoku ka Adiel iŋes apolokinit ŋakais ŋuna eŋadao ŋiboro ŋulu ka apukan. Yonasan lokoku a Usia iŋes apolokinit ŋakais ŋuna eŋadao ŋiboro ŋulu ka apukan, ŋakais ŋuna aya nakiboisyo ŋunace, lotaunio lorerya ka ŋuna aya naduketa ŋunajiet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esiri lokoku a Kelub iŋes apolokinit ŋiketiyak ŋulu etaete ŋimanikorin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simei ŋolo arae Eramasait iŋes apolokinit ŋimanikorin ŋulu ke epiini. Sabidi ŋolo arae Esipimait iŋes apolokinit ŋakais ŋuna eŋadatae epiini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baal-Aman ŋolo arae Egederait iŋes apolokinit ŋikito ka Olipa ka ŋikia ŋulu aya nawaetin a ŋimukura a ŋulu alo To. Yoas iŋes apolokinit ŋakais ŋuna eŋadatae akimyet ŋina ecuyo anaraito ka Olipa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sitirai ŋolo arae Esaronait iŋes apolokinit ŋibaren ŋulu eyokiyo Saron. Sapat lokoku ka Adilai iŋes apolokinit ŋibaren ŋulu eyokiyo nakadipaalae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obil ŋolo arae Emeronosait iŋes apolokinit ŋisipanin a ŋikaala. Yedeia ŋolo arae Emeronosait iŋes apolokinit ŋisipanin a ŋisigirya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yasis ŋolo arae Eagirait iŋes apolokinit ŋisipanin a ŋamesekin. Arae ŋul daadaŋ ŋikapolokinitok ŋulu a ŋiboro ka a ŋibaren a erwosit Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayai lokoku amamae a Daudi ŋolo anyaritae Yonasan, arae iŋes ekeŋarakiniton, ido arae ekile ŋolo apiiryana, nabo arae ŋolo ayeni ŋakiro. Yekiel lokoku ka Acimoni iŋes ainakinitae akitiya aŋuna a ŋidwe ke erwosit a ŋulusapa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aisopel iŋes arae ekeŋarakiniton erwosit. Usai ŋolo arae Earikait iŋes arae ekone ke erwosit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 27:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaku ka Aisopel, abu Yeoiada lokoku a Benaia ka Abiasar kilunyokinos lokicoloŋ keŋ. Yoab iŋes apolokinit ŋasigarya daadaŋ ŋuna ka apukan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.27.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
